# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Tales of Mythic Europe — Front Matter (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Tales of Mythic Europe (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, credits and Author Bios (p. 2) and back cover (p. 168)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The credits, the Author Bios and the back cover, verbatim. The printed Contents and List of Maps (p. 3) are finding
> aids for the book’s own pages and are not converted — every unit they list is converted in its chapter, each map a
> figure record. Page 1 is the cover, with no text.

